<title>PORTUGAL: Ylds eased at Bank/Portugal draining operations.</title>
<headline>Ylds eased at Bank/Portugal draining operations.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said that it drained 33 billion escudos of four-week funds at 6.2258 percent, against 6.2274 percent previously.</p>
<p>It drained just one billion escudos of nine-week funds at 6.1600 percent against 6.1774 percent.</p>
<p>The last such operations were on February 4.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
